@node Main "MintSCAN Help"
@{b}MintSCAN 1.1.0@{ub}

Modern eSCL/AirScan network scanning for classic AmigaOS.

MintSCAN talks directly to a compatible network scanner or multifunction
printer and saves the returned JPEG, PNG or PDF file on the Amiga. No PC
scan server and no scanner-specific Amiga driver are required.

@{"Using the menus" LINK Menus}
@{"Requirements" LINK Requirements}
@{"Installation" LINK Installation}
@{"Quick start" LINK QuickStart}
@{"Scanner profiles" LINK Profiles}
